<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 02:03:01 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>预览模型硬件标准</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/previewing-the-model-hardware-standard</link><description>我们正在向第一批科学研究实验室和先进制造商开放模型硬件标准 (MHS) 的研究预览，这是人工智能代理安全操作物理设备的共享规范。 MHS 使人工智能代理能够并行操作多个实验室和制造仪器，例如显微镜、液体处理机和机械臂，并执行从常规药物发现实验到量子计算机上的激光校准等复杂任务。 MHS 的开发始于 Anthropic 和&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/previewing-the-model-hardware-standard2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 02:02:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/previewing-the-model-hardware-standard</guid></item><item><title>法学硕士预测日常言语行为</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/llms-anticipate-everyday-verbal-behavior</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 01:47:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/llms-anticipate-everyday-verbal-behavior</guid></item><item><title>改变的核糖体有助于解释酶如何促进肿瘤生长</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/altered-ribosomes-help-explain-how-an-enzyme-fuels-tumor-growth</link><description>西北医学的一项新研究发现了一种以前未知的酶促进癌细胞增殖的机制，根据研究结果，将其确立为有希望的癌症治疗靶点&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/altered-ribosomes-help-explain-how-an-enzyme-fuels-tumor-growth2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 01:32:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/altered-ribosomes-help-explain-how-an-enzyme-fuels-tumor-growth</guid></item><item><title>线粒体基因组编辑</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mitochondrial-genome-editing</link><description>线粒体基因组编辑的进展扩大了操纵线粒体 DNA 和线粒体疾病模型的努力。这篇综述讨论了可编程核酸酶和线粒体碱基编辑器的发展、它们在疾病建模和治疗校正中的应用，以及临床转化的关键挑战。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/mitochondrial-genome-editing.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 01:17:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/mitochondrial-genome-editing</guid></item><item><title>气候变化中的冰川涌动和与涌动相关的危险 评论 地球与环境</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/glacier-surging-and-surgerelated-hazards-in-a-changing-climate-reviews-earth-environment</link><description>冰川涌动是冰流快速加速和大规模运输事件，可能威胁附近的社区、基础设施和栖息地。本综述讨论了易于激增的冰川的全球分布、行为和相关危害，以及气候变化如何影响这些冰川。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/glacier-surging-and-surgerelated-hazards-in-a-changing-climate-reviews-earth-environment.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 01:02:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/glacier-surging-and-surgerelated-hazards-in-a-changing-climate-reviews-earth-environment</guid></item><item><title>特工文明的兴衰</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-rise-and-fall-of-agent-civilizations</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 00:47:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-rise-and-fall-of-agent-civilizations</guid></item><item><title>QuEra 的量子计算机在精确频率的激光器上运行，这种精度是肉眼无法看到的，只有原子才能区分</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/queras-quantum-computers-run-on-lasers-held-at-exact-frequencies-a-precision-no-eye-can-see-and-only-the-atoms-can-distinguish</link><description>保持激光存在是一个连续的行为：温度、振动和压力将其推离目标一整天，而分层反馈将其推回目标。当反馈回路出现故障时，锁就会断开，机器就会停止。历史上，将其恢复需要一位特定的专家：他对激光器有直观的了解，并且具有将其恢复到正确状态所需的确切恢复顺序的经验。如果锁在半夜坏了，那个人就必须开车去实验室修理。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/queras-quantum-computers-run-on-lasers-held-at-exact-frequencies-a-precision-no-eye-can-see-and-only-the-atoms-can-distinguish.gif" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:38:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/queras-quantum-computers-run-on-lasers-held-at-exact-frequencies-a-precision-no-eye-can-see-and-only-the-atoms-can-distinguish</guid></item><item><title>患者样本表明，导尿管上的念珠菌可能不仅仅是污染</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/candida-on-urinary-catheters-can-be-more-than-contamination-patient-samples-suggest</link><description>依靠导尿管是每年数十万患者医疗护理的标准组成部分。不幸的是，该装置存在导管相关尿路感染 (CAUTI) 的风险，细菌被广泛认为是其主要原因。然而，许多患者面临着另一种病原体日益严重的威胁：一种真菌，白色念珠菌。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/candida-on-urinary-catheters-can-be-more-than-contamination-patient-samples-suggest.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:23:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/candida-on-urinary-catheters-can-be-more-than-contamination-patient-samples-suggest</guid></item><item><title>科学家发现一种可以阻止乳腺癌扩散的大麻受体</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-discover-a-cannabis-receptor-that-could-stop-breast-cancer-spreading</link><description>事实证明，癌细胞比我们想象的更棘手，因此科学家们为了将生存几率转向对我们有利的方向变得更加棘手。最近的医学研究强调了一个重要问题：癌细胞表现出可塑性。一些癌细胞可以自发地从分化状态恢复到“不成熟”和干细胞样状态，改变其身份以产生更加多样化、更具侵袭性和增殖性的肿瘤。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-discover-a-cannabis-receptor-that-could-stop-breast-cancer-spreading2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 15:08:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-discover-a-cannabis-receptor-that-could-stop-breast-cancer-spreading</guid></item><item><title>脑蛋白研究激发了对自闭症治疗的乐观态度</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/study-of-brain-proteins-spurs-optimism-for-autism-treatments</link><description>研究人员希望他们的发现能够为严重自闭症患者的未来治疗提供参考。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/study-of-brain-proteins-spurs-optimism-for-autism-treatments.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:53:22 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/study-of-brain-proteins-spurs-optimism-for-autism-treatments</guid></item></channel></rss>